> dtxt[,mean(PRIOR_SCORE),by=list(SCHOOL_NUMBER,YEAR)]
     SCHOOL_NUMBER YEAR   V1
[1,]           100 2008   NA
[2,]           200 2009 48.2
[3,]           300 2008   NA
[4,]           400 2009 53.0

or the 'by without by' direct way :

> setkey(dtxt,SCHOOL_NUMBER,YEAR)
> dtxt[J(c(200,400),2009),mean(PRIOR_SCORE),mult="all"]
